Hi Chris,

Sorry for the delay.
For meta() you don't need them to be on the same grid. But for pkde(), overlap(), encounter(), cde() you do. Calculating them on the same grid doesn't hurt anything, as long as the grid is sufficient to capture the details of the distribution, which the default grid will do.
Yes.
Best,
Chris

